---
import CardServices from "../Widgets/CardServices.astro";
---

<section
  id="servicios"
  class="w-full px-6 py-24 bg-white border-t border-zinc-100"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div
      class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end gap-6 mb-20"
    >
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <span
          class="text-red-600 font-black uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-xs block"
          >Expertos en Cuidado</span
        >
        <h2
          class="text-6xl md:text-9xl font-black text-black tracking-tighter uppercase italic leading-[0.8] transition-all duration-700"
        >
          Servicios de <br />
          <span class="text-red-600">Lavado</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-6 max-w-sm">
        <p class="text-zinc-500 font-medium text-xl leading-tight">
          Tecnología y pasión para mantener tu flota impecable. Resultados que
          se notan en la calle.
        </p>
        <div class="h-1 w-20 bg-red-600"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <CardServices />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
